$ORIGIN test.
$TTL 300
@           SOA ns1.test. hostmaster.test. 1 1800 900 604800 60
@           NS  ns1
ns1         A   10.53.0.5
www.lab     A   10.10.0.10
; short TTL, used by the stale-cache scenario
short.lab 5 A   10.10.0.11
; every u<random>.lab.test resolves, so each query is a cache miss
*.lab    60 A   10.10.0.99
